I see the issue! The CHANGELOG has `## [Unreleased]` followed immediately by `## [0.3.14] - 2026-03-10`. This is incorrect according to the Keep a Changelog format. If `0.3.14` has been released (has a date), it should not be under `[Unreleased]`. The `[Unreleased]` section should only contain changes that haven't been released yet.

The correct structure should be:
- `## [Unreleased]` (for upcoming changes)
- `## [0.3.14] - YYYY-MM-DD` (only if 0.3.14 has been released)
- `## [0.3.13] - 2026-02-25`

